      <CodeBlock code={"apiVersion: flows.netobserv.io/v1beta2\nkind: FlowCollector\nmetadata:\n  name: cluster\nspec:\n  namespace: netobserv\n  networkPolicy:\n    enable: true\n    additionalNamespaces: [\"openshift-console\", \"openshift-monitoring\"]\n# ..."} lang="yaml" title="Example FlowCollector CR for network policy" />
      <p>where:</p>
      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold"><code>spec.networkPolicy.enable</code></dt>
